      "message": "[error] Line 228: 🔴 `syncAttachments` is set once for the imported account and is never cleared or scoped to a conversation whose attachment search succeeded. This disables `handleIncomingFile()` for every history page for the lifetime of the account; if the search returns 0, fails, or misses a page, those transfers remain awaiting host with no fallback download. Track an active per-conversation sync/search state (and clear it when the search completes), or retain the normal auto-accept path when no sync request is active.",
