      "message": "[error] Line 397: 🔴 `fileTransferInfo()` is a daemon/D-Bus call and can fail once a queued transfer is canceled, expires, or is removed. This timer callback has no exception handling, unlike `CallbacksHandler::slotDataTransferEvent()`, which catches failures around the same call. Handle the failure per attachment and release/remove that slot so one terminal transfer cannot propagate out of the event loop and stop the queue.",
